%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 416957903ce8daa4cbf8b3a61dc43588, type: 3}
  m_Name: GrayReturnDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueInstance
  steps:
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: You're back! Good timing—I'm trying a few new arrangements for future
      deliveries.
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f4dd71feaee8d84ab55b30b45a37c8e, type: 3}
    text: ...
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: Spike wrote back?
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f4dd71feaee8d84ab55b30b45a37c8e, type: 3}
    text: ...
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: It just says... "Thanks."
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: That's it? Thanks?
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f4dd71feaee8d84ab55b30b45a37c8e, type: 3}
    text: ...
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: No, no, that's a perfectly normal answer. A concise answer. Efficient.
      Very Spike.
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: Do you think they hated the flower? Was the flower too much?
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: Maybe the letter was too much. Maybe I should go talk to them.
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f4dd71feaee8d84ab55b30b45a37c8e, type: 3}
    text: ......
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: Or maybe showing up in person is more intense. I could wait. I could
      not wait.
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: I'm going to make tea and decide whether that counts as a decision.
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: Thanks for taking it, Hermes. Seriously.
